cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "mimic-iv-ecg-ntprobnp-reproducibility"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Alkhaleefah"
    given-names: "Mohammad"

abstract: >
  Reproducibility code for constructing the MIMIC-IV external validation cohort,
  matching electrocardiograms (ECGs) with NT-proBNP measurements within ±24 hours,
  generating standardized 12-lead ECG images, extracting the single-lead ECG
  (Lead I), and preprocessing data for deep learning-based BNP and NT-proBNP
  estimation from wearable-compatible single-lead ECG images.

